WEBVTT

00:00:59.738 --> 00:01:02.906
Nje perkthim per al-jebra eshte

00:01:02.906 --> 00:01:06.605
"Sistemi për pajtimin e pjeseve te ndara."

00:01:06.605 --> 00:01:10.655
Al-jebra arriti te vinte ne gjuhen anglesze si algjebra.

00:01:10.655 --> 00:01:12.822
Nje shembull nder shume.

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:16.788
Textet arabike qe mbaritn kete urtesi matmatikore

00:01:16.788 --> 00:01:18.571
me ne fund mberrijne ne Europe--

00:01:18.571 --> 00:01:19.857
ose me saktesisht, Spanje--

00:01:19.857 --> 00:01:22.322
ne shekullin e 11-te dhe 12-te.

00:01:22.322 --> 00:01:23.472
Kur ata mberriten

00:01:23.472 --> 00:01:25.355
kishte nje interes shume te madh

00:01:25.355 --> 00:01:27.089
ne perkthimin e kesaj urtesije

00:01:27.089 --> 00:01:28.738
ne gjuhet Europiane.

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:30.756
Por kishte probleme.